  "change_note": "Desktop pairs merged Core #218/#219 at Pi 1.0.2: G2 checkpoint recovery, public next_step, owner-scoped execution and four-call budget projections. Bridge 1.1 and Runtime v1 identities and both component manifests are refreshed together; the 12 commands and occurrence v1.2 identity remain unchanged. Desktop SDK versions and the fixed Core Pi Durable 1.0.2 bundle are checked before staging. Session history remains canonical in SessionManager. Durable stays Core-owned and disabled; no Desktop execution database or automatic G3/G4 activation is added. G1/G2 require current scoped owner grants, source proof and durable budget. G5 recipients, unconfirmed material evidence, and term/lesson attribution remain unverified; external_send=false."
